{"id":"661306","name":"番茄排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661306/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"适量肋排备用。","img":"images/661306/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将排骨改刀切块清水泡发洗净。","img":"images/661306/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"番茄去皮切块备用。","img":"images/661306/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油，放入排骨煎至微焦，生抽，蚝油，老抽炒均匀上色。","img":"images/661306/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入番茄，炒出茄汁。","img":"images/661306/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入煎炒过的排骨。","img":"images/661306/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/661306/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火煮开转小火。","img":"images/661306/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上煲45-60分钟左右。","img":"images/661306/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"排骨焖至软烂入味后大火收汁即可。","img":"images/661306/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661306/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661306/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661306/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}